---
title: "C4 Level 2 — Runtime: selection and evidence refresh"
---
flowchart TB
  harness["<b>Agent harness</b><br/>[Software System — external]<br/>Keeps chosen model for full conversation<br/>or full subagent task"]:::ext
  evidence["<b>Evidence sources</b><br/>[Software System — external]<br/>Provider APIs and benchmark pages;<br/>untrusted input"]:::ext
  subgraph gold["Goldilocks plugin — proposed runtime"]
    adapter["<b>Harness adapter</b><br/>[Component: hook or plugin]<br/>Selects before first request or spawn;<br/>never on later turns or compaction"]:::comp
    log[("<b>Mandatory decision log</b><br/>[Data store: local file, schema open]<br/>Attempts, outcomes and failure reasons;<br/>metadata only, no task text")]:::cont
    engine["<b>Local decision engine</b><br/>[Container: run_decision.py]<br/>Filters, scores, calibrates and ranks;<br/>process or daemon still open"]:::cont
    config[("<b>User config</b><br/>[Data store: file]<br/>Allowed models/providers and constraints")]:::cont
    weights[("<b>Local weights</b><br/>[Data store: pinned HF revision]<br/>Fine-tuned Laya and calibration")]:::cont
    store[("<b>Evidence cache</b><br/>[Data store: results.json]<br/>Validated candidate features and freshness")]:::cont
    refresh["<b>Refresh coordination</b><br/>[Component: skill / code, unresolved]<br/>Checks age and allowed-list changes"]:::comp
    fetcher["<b>Evidence fetcher</b><br/>[Container: fetch_evidence.py]<br/>Typed APIs or isolated tool-less extraction;<br/>validates source and candidate associations"]:::cont
  end
  harness -->|"Supplies opening prompt or subagent instructions"| adapter
  adapter -->|"Requests one pick [local JSON]"| engine
  engine -->|"Reads constraints"| config
  engine -->|"Loads model"| weights
  engine -->|"Reads candidate features"| store
  engine -->|"Returns pick, confidence, runners-up"| adapter
  adapter -->|"Applies pick; on model failure keeps harness default as-is"| harness
  adapter -->|"Records every attempt and native fallback"| log
  refresh -->|"Triggers refresh when needed"| fetcher
  fetcher -->|"Fetches candidate evidence [HTTPS]"| evidence
  fetcher -->|"Validates and writes atomically"| store
